                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 31.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-char-indent-count: 3.0" class=MsoNormal align=left><FONT size=3><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>4</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日，欧莱雅校园市场策划大赛中国赛区决赛在上海举行，北京大学光华管理学院蒋可旖</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>(Lucia)</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">同学、香港中文大学（深圳）经管学院的戚逸文（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Leann</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">）和叶奇（</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Kiki</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">）三位同学组成跨校队伍参赛，作为全国唯一一支大一组队的队伍，她们和全国著名高校大三大四的学长展开激烈比拼，通过层层筛选与竞争，最终斩获全国四强佳绩！这三位女生均是我校</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届优秀毕业生，为博雅的一中学子喝彩！</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019042914073864.png" onload=resizepic(this)></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">中国区决赛现场</SPAN><SPAN style="COLOR: blue" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">               从左到右分别为蒋可旖</SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>(Lucia)</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，戚逸文<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt">（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Leann</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">）和</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">叶奇<SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt">（</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt" lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Kiki</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">）</SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 18pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; LETTER-SPACING: 1.35pt; COLOR: blue; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN> </P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">据悉，欧莱雅校园市场策划大赛发起于</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>1992</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年，是由欧莱雅集团主办的一项全球最著名的国际性大学生营销和品牌管理赛事。比赛的目的是为了提供给学生有关于美容行业教学和专业经验以及大胆创新创造的机会，同时也是欧莱雅国际人力资源传播战略的一部分。今年的题目与活性化妆品部门相关：为注重健康的客户发明创造未来的护肤体验。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019042914081652.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN style="COLOR: blue" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">获奖队伍采访</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT face=Calibri><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US>Q</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">你们当时想要报名参加这个比赛的原因是什么呢？</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">戚逸文</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：是在机缘巧合下，我和叶奇一起挤地铁的时候看到了欧莱雅</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Brainstorm</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">的邮件。在此之前对这个比赛其实没有太多了解，但是抱着要多尝试的想法，我们决定参赛。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">叶奇</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：其实作为大一的学生，我并没有很多参加商赛的经验。但在我看来，参加商赛有助于培养创造力和批判性思维以及解决问题的能力。此外，欧莱雅是一个化妆品公司，我对化妆品产业有很浓厚的兴趣。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">蒋可旖</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：我参加比赛的原因主要是受到我的好朋友叶奇以及戚逸文的邀请。同时我认为这个比赛也是一次挑战自我的机会。所以我非常珍惜这次机会并且全力以赴。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = v ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" /><v:shapetype id=_x0000_t75 stroked="f" filled="f" path="m@4@5l@4@11@9@11@9@5xe" o:preferrelative="t" o:spt="75" coordsize="21600,21600"><v:stroke joinstyle="miter"></v:stroke><v:formulas><v:f eqn="if lineDrawn pixelLineWidth 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 1 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum 0 0 @1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @2 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @3 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @0 0 1"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @6 1 2"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelWidth"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @8 21600 0"></v:f><v:f eqn="prod @7 21600 pixelHeight"></v:f><v:f eqn="sum @10 21600 0"></v:f></v:formulas><v:path o:connecttype="rect" gradientshapeok="t" o:extrusionok="f"></v:path><o:lock aspectratio="t" v:ext="edit"></o:lock></v:shapetype><v:shape style="WIDTH: 24pt; HEIGHT: 24pt; VISIBILITY: visible; mso-wrap-style: square; mso-left-percent: -10001; mso-top-percent: -10001; mso-position-horizontal: absolute; mso-position-horizontal-relative: char; mso-position-vertical: absolute; mso-position-vertical-relative: line" id=图片_x0020_1 alt="说明: IMG_256" type="#_x0000_t75" o:spid="_x0000_s1027"><FONT size=3><?xml:namespace prefix = w ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" /><w:wrap type="none"></w:wrap><w:anchorlock></w:anchorlock></FONT></v:shape><FONT face=Calibri><FONT size=3><STRONG>Q</STRONG><o:p></o:p></FONT></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">你们在准备比赛的过程中有遇到什么困难和挑战吗？你们又是如何解决的呢？</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">戚逸文</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：由于是大一学生，我们的经验和专业知识都几乎为零。所以我们在问卷设置，幻灯片展示的框架，时间安排与管理方面都遇到了许多问题。由于缺乏做问卷的经验，问卷的选项可能考虑得不够全面，还设置了一些无效问题。而幻灯片展示的框架不够清晰，可能会让人找不到重点或是难以跟上逻辑。这里特别感谢苏丽文教授的指导，她帮我们整理了逻辑，理清了脉络，同时也教给我们很多欠缺的知识。还有就是由于准备比赛的两周恰好就是期中考试周，时间的安排非常紧凑，我们需要<STRONG>去作出一些时间上的取舍</STRONG>。有好几天我们都是准备幻灯片到凌晨三四点，早上七点多起连轴转的生活。那几天的心情会有点烦躁，但是很幸运的是，我们的队长叶奇并没有表现出过于烦躁的状态。她反倒是保持相对的冷静并且努力平缓我们的情绪。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">叶奇</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>: </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我们经常质疑我们的想法是否足够可行和新颖。但是，我认为<STRONG>树立自信心很重要</STRONG>。所以我们重新梳理了逻辑并进行了大量的研究，使我们的想法足够新颖可行。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">蒋可旖</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：对于我来说，我在准备比赛的过程中遇到的最大的问题就是地理位置上的限制。因为叶奇和戚逸文在同一个学校，所以她们一起练习很方便。但是我只能和她们通过视频电话沟通交流，不过我们经常视频电话去调整我们的稿子和幻灯片展示。在此我真的非常感谢在整个比赛过程中她们的理解与帮助。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201904/2019042914105850.png" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan" align=center><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">中国区决赛现场</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT face=Calibri><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US>Q</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">你们参加这次比赛有什么感想与收获吗？</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">戚逸文</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：我很喜欢准备比赛过程中那种<STRONG>忙碌的充实感</STRONG>，也很喜欢<STRONG>和队友一起朝一个目标前进的感觉</STRONG>。同时也特别感谢苏教授，比赛前两天腿受伤了，依旧视频指导我们；也很感谢经管学院老师</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>Estella</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">像大姐姐一样的陪伴。在上海比赛的时候，我们遇到了很多优秀的人，看到了自己的优点，也看到了自己的不足和努力的方向。我也意识到，<STRONG>队友间的默契和信任真的很重要</STRONG>。我真的要感谢队长叶奇，每一次更改结构之前我都会有些小郁闷与忐忑，她给予了我很多鼓励。最后就是希望能在未来的学习中掌握<STRONG>更多的专业知识</STRONG>，也通过这次的参赛经验，<STRONG>提高制作幻灯片和写手稿的效率</STRONG>。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="mso-pagination: widow-orphan"><FONT size=3><STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">叶奇</SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">：我学会了<STRONG>如何把一个粗略的想法变成了一个具体详细的商业模型</STRONG>。我的逻辑推理能力也得到了提高。同时，我也学会了如何去进行<STRONG>有效的小组合作</STRONG>，如何带领一个团队解决问题并且以积极的态度面临困难与挑战。</SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
